@startuml
skinparam {
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ControlBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  EntityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ActorBorderColor black
  BoundaryBorderColor black
  ControlBorderColor black
  EntityBorderColor black
  DatabaseBorderColor black
}

actor User
boundary "Stories Page" as UI
boundary Router
control MangaController as MC
control MangaService as MS
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open stories page
activate User
activate UI

User -> UI: 2. Enter keyword / select filters / sort
UI -> Router: 3. GET /api/manga/get/all?page&limit&filters
activate Router

Router -> MC: 4. getAll(page, limit)
activate MC
MC -> MC: 5. Parse + clamp page/limit

MC -> MS: 6. getAllManga(p, l)
activate MS

MS -> MongoDB: 7. aggregate(pipeline match isDeleted=false,isPublish=true + lookups + filters)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> MS: 8. {data,total} (data may be empty)
deactivate MongoDB

MS --> MC: 9. return {data,total}
deactivate MS

MC --> Router: 10. HTTP 200 {data,total,page,limit}
deactivate MC

Router --> UI: 11. Render list / empty state
deactivate Router
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml